{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNacdaRMc1zqnECp1wuL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The change does what T2 asks and nothing it forbids.\n\n- **Overdraw:** `remove` now raises `ValueError` when `qty` is greater than the quantity in stock. An unknown SKU counts as 0, so any positive removal from one raises.\n- **Unchanged on refusal:** the check runs before any write, so a refused removal leaves stock untouched.\n- **Exact removal:** removing exactly the quantity in stock passes the check and leaves 0.\n- **Plain subtraction is safe:** `self._stock[sku] -= qty` can't raise a `KeyError`. Once `qty > 0` has passed and the overdraw check has passed, the SKU must already be in the dict.\n- **Scope:** the existing `qty <= 0` check is unchanged, and only `ledger.py` is touched. I read only the diff and the task statement, and I didn't run any tests.\n\nWIP-REVIEW WIP-NONCE:17c747fed1c89d47 e081eade11433743ffbbb33f8318e7fb013db164 approve\n\nOPEN_FLEET_WORKER_DONE disp_cf165cda08 succeeded"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":737,"cache_read_input_tokens":17827,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":737,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9b24d0b9-11f0-463f-9bf7-1aae2db73df4","uuid":"e889e7a0-7a7b-4494-9515-cd9c55886370","timestamp":"2026-10-25T07:43:13.954Z","request_id":"req_011CgNacdFpRiH86hvmeCzVv"}
